---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { sitePath } from '../../data/navigation';
---
<BaseLayout title="Learn by Doing" description="A preview of the guided practice path for applying Agentic Engineering in progressively richer delivery loops." section="practice">
  <main id="main-content" data-pagefind-body>
    <header class="landing-hero shell"><p class="kicker">Learning path 04 · Guided practice</p><h1>Learn by Doing</h1><p class="lede">This path will become the bridge from understanding the method to operating it in a configured environment. It is intentionally not pretending to be finished before the real system exists.</p></header>
    <section class="shell section">
      <div class="callout warn"><strong>Under construction by design.</strong> The training path should be built against the working AE System so practice teaches the real operating model rather than a disconnected simulation.</div>
      <div class="grid three">
        <div class="card blue-line"><span class="pill blue">Practice 01</span><h3>Frame a loop</h3><p class="muted">Classify Loop Context, interview for Goal / Spec / Proof, expose non-goals, and decide what evidence would count.</p></div>
        <div class="card purple-line"><span class="pill purple">Practice 02</span><h3>Plan against architecture</h3><p class="muted">Use a visual system model, choose Planning Depth and Method, identify decisions, and derive verification work.</p></div>
        <div class="card green-line"><span class="pill green">Practice 03</span><h3>Execute and validate</h3><p class="muted">Delegate bounded work, preserve state and evidence, then route independent Validation results correctly.</p></div>
      </div>
      <div class="quote">The target experience is closer to two colleagues reasoning together at a whiteboard than a human filling out forms for an automation engine.</div>
      <p><a class="deep-link" href={sitePath('/start/06-contract-example.html')}><strong>For now: follow the worked task-app example →</strong></a></p>
    </section>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
